  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While Fang Yuan prepares a luck connection near an oasis, a moving sand figure shouts that Plump Lady has chased thief Ling Hu for countless miles and demands immortal essence stones back. She stands on yellow sand waves and presses the attack with sand waves even after he denies being that thief.",
      "chapters": [
        674
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is an extremely fat female Gu Immortal with a thick waist and broad shoulders, like a water tank.",
      "chapters": [
        674
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a corpulent body, her belly is bulging, and her entire body resembles a water vat.",
      "chapters": [
        1973
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When she uses martial sand armor, yellow sand gushes from her ears and envelops her entire body. She turns into a sand giant with a thicker body.",
      "chapters": [
        674
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She raises martial sand armor into a sand giant.",
      "chapters": [
        674
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sand-fight-and-escape",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After that defense breaks she uses burial dragon sand coffin to bury him under desert pressure she once used to suppress a desolate beast evil dragon. When he breaks free she names herself Mo clan’s Gu Immortal chasing a thief, then flees with light sand escape so fast his light illusion bat wings cannot catch her.",
      "chapters": [
        675
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sand-fight-and-escape",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_mo_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later places her battle strength at the upper tier of rank six, with three powerful mortal killer moves and that escape move as the end of the fight.",
      "chapters": [
        681
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sand-fight-and-escape",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Western Desert’s Gu Immortal world titles her Plump Lady. She likes the title, publicly uses it, and in time her original name is forgotten in its place. She is a Mo clan member, a Western Desert super force, cultivates earth path with an ordinary earth path inheritance, and runs sand farms in her immortal aperture that produce light sand and cold-warm flowing sand.",
      "chapters": [
        1973
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "title-and-earth-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert"
      ]
    }
  ],
